# Amelioration - Rolling Update sans coupure : maxUnavailable 0 + maxSurge 1 + preStop (sleep 5 s)
$ diff deployment.yaml deployment-rolling-zero-downtime.yaml
0a1,5
> # Amelioration (Partie 4) : Rolling Update sans aucune coupure
> #  - maxUnavailable: 0 / maxSurge: 1 : on n'arrete un ancien pod qu'apres qu'un nouveau soit pret
> #  - preStop sleep 5 s : quand un pod passe en Terminating, il est retire des endpoints du Service,
> #    mais kube-proxy met un court instant a mettre a jour iptables sur tous les noeuds.
> #    On retarde donc l'envoi de SIGTERM a httpd pour qu'il continue a servir pendant cette propagation.
8a14,18
>   strategy:
>     type: RollingUpdate
>     rollingUpdate:
>       maxUnavailable: 0
>       maxSurge: 1
16a27
>       terminationGracePeriodSeconds: 30
22d32
<         # Le pod ne recoit du trafic (endpoint du Service) que lorsque httpd accepte les connexions
26a37,40
>         lifecycle:
>           preStop:
>             sleep:
>               seconds: 5

# Etape 1 : mise en place de la nouvelle configuration (rollout non mesure : les anciens pods n'ont pas encore de preStop)
$ kubectl apply -f deployment-rolling-zero-downtime.yaml
deployment.apps/web-app configured

$ kubectl annotate deployment/web-app kubernetes.io/change-cause="v4 : httpd:2.4 + preStop + maxUnavailable 0 (deployment-rolling-zero-downtime.yaml)" --overwrite
deployment.apps/web-app annotated

$ kubectl rollout status deployment/web-app --timeout=180s
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 old replicas are pending termination...
deployment "web-app" successfully rolled out

# Etape 2 : nouvelle mise a jour d'image (vers httpd:latest), mesuree par la sonde
$ kubectl run availability-probe --image=curlimages/curl --restart=Never --command -- sh -c 'i=0; while true; do i=$((i+1)); c=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -m 1 -w "%{http_code}" http://web-app); echo "$(date +%T) #$i $c"; sleep 0.1; done'
pod/availability-probe created

$ kubectl set image deployment/web-app httpd=httpd:latest
deployment.apps/web-app image updated

$ kubectl annotate deployment/web-app kubernetes.io/change-cause="v5 : httpd:latest, rolling update sans coupure" --overwrite
deployment.apps/web-app annotated

$ kubectl rollout status deployment/web-app --timeout=180s
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 1 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
Waiting for deployment "web-app" rollout to finish: 2 out of 3 new replicas have been updated...
